":"fix5","w":"stones"},"d":1}],"chimes":[{"s":"fix2","w":"frame"},{"s":"congrats"}]},"codeShots":true,"why":"A river in its own valley (terrain with a riverbed, a river in it from the first frame), a toy boat drifting down it. The weight's path is the story: a plank snaps, a slab on piers cracks, an arch over a frame pushes the piers apart, packed stone holds them, a flood slams the solid piers, flood arches let it through, the rushing water digs the riverbed out, riprap stones fix it; the cart rolls across at the end. The camera opens on the plank, then holds the bridge's front with the river in section.","hold":true,"story":{"flow":["plank","bridge","floodWater","scour"]}},"sentences":[{"role":"hook","text":"If you lay a plank across a river, you have a bridge."},{"role":"problem","text":"But a loaded cart snaps the plank."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you lay a slab on stone piers."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But under the weight, the long slab cracks."},{"role":"fix2","text":"So you curve wedge stones over a wooden frame."},{"role":"name","text":"This is an arch bridge."},{"role":"problem3","text":"But without the frame, the arch pushes the piers apart."},{"role":"fix3","text":"So you pack heavy stone behind each pier."},{"role":"problem4","text":"But a flood rises and pounds against the piers."},{"role":"fix4","text":"So you open a flood arch through each pier."},{"role":"problem5","text":"But water rushing through digs out the riverbed."},{"role":"fix5","text":"So you pile big stones around their feet."},{"role":"finish","text":"Pave the road, and a cart rolls across the river."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built an arch bridge."}],"story":{"title":"Ancient stone arch bridge","hero":"a stone arch bridge","flow":["deck","arch","piers","riverbed","river"],"recurring":{"p":"boat","what":"a toy boat drifting down the river"},"chain":[{"problem":"problem","causedBy":"hook","shows":"the loaded cart rolls on and the plank snaps in two","stakes":"the cart falls in the river","size":3,"at":"deck","scale":"part"},{"problem":"problem2","causedBy":"fix1","shows":"the long stone slab cracks in the middle under a heavy block","stakes":"the next cart falls through","size":4,"at":"deck","scale":"thing"},{"problem":"problem3","causedBy":"fix2","shows":"without its frame the arch pushes the piers apart","stakes":"the arch falls in","size":5,"at":"arch","scale":"thing"},{"problem":"problem4","causedBy":"fix3","shows":"a flood rises to the arch and slams into the heavy piers, lifting a boat","stakes":"the whole bridge is pushed over","size":7,"at":"piers","scale":"river"},{"problem":"problem5","causedBy":"fix4","shows":"water rushing through the flood arches digs out the riverbed and the piers sink","stakes":"the bridge sinks into the river","size":8,"at":"riverbed","scale":"river"}],"ideas":[{"role":"hook","idea":"a plank laid across a river is already a bridge"},{"role":"problem","idea":"a loaded cart is too heavy and the plank snaps"},{"role":"fix1","idea":"stone piers on both banks with a stone slab across"},{"role":"problem2","idea":"the long slab bends under the weight and cracks"},{"role":"fix2","idea":"wedge stones curved over a wooden frame make an arch that is only squeezed"},{"role":"name","idea":"this is an arch bridge"},{"role":"problem3","idea":"the arch pushes outward and shoves the piers apart"},{"role":"fix3","idea":"heavy stone packed behind the piers holds them"},{"role":"problem4","idea":"the heavy solid piers now block a spring flood, which slams into them"},{"role":"fix4","idea":"flood arches through the piers let the floodwater pass"},{"role":"problem5","idea":"the water rushing through digs the riverbed out from under the piers"},{"role":"fix5","idea":"big stones piled round the pier feet stop the digging"},{"role":"finish","idea":"paved road and walls: a cart rolls across over the river"},{"role":"congrats","idea":"you have built a stone arch bridge"}]},"warnings":["part land is never animate